Revision history for Perl extension MooX-MouseTypeConstraints

{{$NEXT}}

    - Fix incorrect handling of coercions: values are no longer
      validated against their coerced form while the original value
      is stored. Coercions are now applied only when an attribute is
      declared with `coerce => 1`, following Mouse semantics, and the
      coerced value is what gets stored. (reported by haarg, #1)

0.01 2021-07-30T04:13:58Z

    - original version

